<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>ClosedXML</id>
    <version>0.92.1</version>
    <title>ClosedXML</title>
    <authors>Amir Ghezelbash,Francois Botha,Manuel De Leon</authors>
    <owners>Amir Ghezelbash,Francois Botha,Manuel De Leon</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/ClosedXML/ClosedXML/blob/master/LICENSE</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/ClosedXML/ClosedXML</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://download-codeplex.sec.s-msft.com/Download?ProjectName=closedxml&amp;DownloadId=167541&amp;Build=21031</iconUrl>
    <description>ClosedXML makes it easier for developers to create Excel 2007+ (.xlsx, .xlsm, etc) files. It provides a nice object oriented way to manipulate the files (similar to VBA) without dealing with the hassles of XML Documents. It can be used by any .NET language like C# and VisualBasic.NET.</description>
    <summary>ClosedXML makes it easier for developers to create Excel 2007+ (.xlsx, .xlsm, etc) files. It provides a nice object oriented way to manipulate the files (similar to VBA) without dealing with the hassl</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/ClosedXML/ClosedXML/issues?q=is%3Aissue+milestone%3Av0.92+is%3Aclosed

.NET Standard 2.0 now supported!

Breaking changes:
XLPivotField class is no longer public
IXLRangeAddress.IsInvalid property removed
IXLRangeAddress.IsValid property added
XLClearOptions refactors into a flag enum. The applicable Clear() methods were updated accordingly.</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>@ClosedXML</copyright>
    <dependencies>
      <group targetFramework=".NETFramework4.0">
        <dependency id="DocumentFormat.OpenXml" version="2.7.2" />
        <dependency id="ExcelNumberFormat" version="1.0.3" />
        <dependency id="FastMember.Signed" version="1.3.0" />
      </group>
      <group targetFramework=".NETFramework4.6">
        <dependency id="DocumentFormat.OpenXml" version="2.7.2" />
        <dependency id="ExcelNumberFormat" version="1.0.3" />
        <dependency id="FastMember.Signed" version="1.3.0" />
      </group>
      <group targetFramework=".NETStandard2.0">
        <dependency id="System.Drawing.Common" version="4.5.0-preview1-25914-04" />
        <dependency id="DocumentFormat.OpenXml" version="2.7.2" />
        <dependency id="ExcelNumberFormat" version="1.0.3" />
        <dependency id="FastMember.Signed" version="1.3.0" />
      </group>
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
</package>